  ⭐ DSC is the ordering information AVAILABLE in the composed index — shared by both
     arms by construction. MCB is what each EMISSION then throws away. ⛔ DSC(-x) is
     printed because DSC=0 means no isotone-INCREASING information, not none.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6 · ⭐⭐ THE HEADROOM — the most B could EVER win, on this index, at this tau
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ⭐ ``CRPS_ORD`` is the best score ANY forecast that is isotone in x can achieve in
     sample. A rank-coupled emission is such a forecast BY CONSTRUCTION — it is a
     monotone map from x to magnitudes. ⇒ ``MCB_A`` IS the whole prize: the entire
     amount a perfected B could take off A, on this index. It is not an estimate of it.

